---
// src/pages/post/creator.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-5">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold">
      BIM Software Development and Consulting
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      I'm an AI enthusiast Licensed Architect, BIM Modeler and Full Stack BIM Software Developer with a multidisciplinary background spanning Design, Architecture, Art, Technology, Software Engineering, AI integrations and cloud-based development.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      My skill include interdisicplinary problem solving, AI driven development, .NET desktop applications, Revit & AutoCAD API programming, Revit Dynamo scripting, Custom Dynamo nodes development, full-stack Web/Cloud solutions, BIM modeling, leadership, writing and speaking.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      I feel confortable working in interdisciplinary, intercultural, inter-generational and inclusive remote and on-site teams.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
